  "articleBody": "A reliable bedroom addition starts with a written scope, site review, design development, permit planning, and a construction plan that accounts for how the new room connects to the existing house. Gather property information, decide the room’s function and features, compare qualified proposals by scope rather than headline price, and confirm who coordinates design, permits, inspections, and construction.",
